    "headgroup": "PFSA = PFCA * exp(-1.1)  (Tang2026 + Yamazaki2023 TF: PFOS/PFOA ~0.26-0.43; sign CONFIRMED PFSA<PFCA; was placeholder exp(-1.5))",
